    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A Beautiful Bright and very Spacious 1st Floor Two Bedroom (1 Bath) Apartment superbly located in the centre of the University town of Maynooth. Having been very obviously well maintained and cared for by its present owner, the property boasts an excellent Ber Energy Rating of B with a new Gas Boiler being installed only a few years ago, plus Triple Glazed windows to Front aspect and Side,  and Double Glazed windows to the rear. Electrical PIR Inspection and certification was completed in February 2026. With an active Management Company in place in the development,  excellent upgrades have also been completed for all eight Apartment blocks with new Fascias, Soffits, Downpipes, gutters being installed along with external painting and internal painting of communal areas and fitting of new carpets in hallways and common areas. There is an abundance of secure car parking accessed securely via Electric Vehicular and Pedestrian gates, while the development also enjoys an extensive and picturesque Green area.  Each Apartment has an intercom Security system and in addition to the Mains Gas Heating the apartment also comes with the added benefit of a solid fuel fireplace !!!!. \r\nThe Location of the Apartment is simply outstanding, being a short stroll to the nearby Train Station and almost beside a Bus Terminus highlighting the fantastic commuter services available in Maynooth. All the many other amenities on offer in the University town of Maynooth are also at hand such as Shops, Schools, Restaurants and Cafes, Sporting and Recreational facilities etc etc. \r\nThe Property comprises Entrance Hall with Two excellent storage presses off, a large ' Open Plan ' layout of Kitchen/Dining/Living area, a Large Master Bedroom and a Single Bedroom along with Bathroom.\r\n\r\nWith regard to the property being attractive or suitable as an investment, the conservative figure for monthly rental income would be in the region of 1600/1700 euro per month while the Annual Maintenance Charge is a very reasonable 1,788 euro.\r\n\r\nPRICE REGION ;; 325,000.00 EURO                                       BER CERT ; B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall                                                                               Carpeted. Intercom Phone. Hotpress off and Storage Press off. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Area               18'6'' d 16'8''                  Open Plan style area with shelved Archway into Kitchen. Excellent range of built in Kitchen units with Free standing Electric Cooker, Fridge/Freezer, Washing machine/Dryer. Extractor hood.  Gas Boiler. Stainless steel sink. \r\nDual Aspect. Feature Fireplace with wooden surround and marble hearth.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom                                12'9'' x 12'3''                   Carpeted. Built in Wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2                                          9'2'' x 7'7''                        Carpeted. Built in Wardrobes\r\n\r\nBathroom                                           12'9'' x 5'0''                       WC, WHB set in Storage unit, Bath with Bath screen. Electric Shower overhead. Partly tiled walls. Wall mounted mirror with overhead light.  Attic access. \r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "ADDITIONAL FEATURES ;\r\n\r\nExcellent Ber Rating of B - (Ber Rating after May 2026) Certificate No 119777027\r\nTriple Glazed windows to front and side, Double Glazed Windows to rear\r\nNew Gas Boiler fitted only a few years ago with 10 year Warranty.\r\nElectrical PIR Inspection and Certification February 2026\r\nElectric Gated Entrance for Vehicles and separately for Pedestrians\r\nIntercom Security System in Place\r\nAn abundance of secure and safe parking within the Electric Gated Entrance\r\nNew Fascias, Soffits, Downpipes, Gutters, Exterior and Internal painting and newly fitted carpets in internal communal areas.\r\nAnnual Maintenance Charge a very reasonable 1788 per annum\r\nSolid Fuel Fireplace in Livingroom\r\nExcellent investment returns achievable with conservative monthly rental rates of 1600/1700 euro \r\nSuperb Town Centre location within short walking distance of the nearby Train Station, practically adjacent Bus Depots, Schools, Shops, Restaurants and Cafes, Sporting and Recreational facilities. Quick motoring Access to the Motorway\r\nApartment presented in pristine condition having been well maintained and decorated by its current owner.\r\nLovely Green area to the side"
      },
